# Small multimodal projector files (mmproj-*.gguf) checked against llama.cpp's CPU encoder,
# which test_gguf_mmproj.py builds at the pinned revision in llama_cpp_oracle.py.
#
# Format: projector,repo_id,filename[,mark,reason]
#   projector - the file's encoder projector types, "+"-joined when it has vision and audio
#               (see src/frontends/gguf/docs/mmproj.md)
#   repo_id   - Hugging Face Hub repo hosting the file
#   filename  - the projector file in that repo
#   mark      - optional: "skip", "xfail", or "nmse=<limit>" to replace the device's limit
#   reason    - required if mark is set
